THAT Council:

        1.   Proceed with the consideration of the temporary use permit for a
             commercial office at 2874 Peatt Road, subject to the following terms and
             conditions:

             i.    That the temporary use permit be issued for a period of three years
                   from time of issuance;

             ii.   That there are no clients on site;

             iii. That a business licence and building permit be obtained from the City of
                  Langford;

THAT Council consider the following as policing priorities for the West Shore RCMP in
             2025:

                 •      Police presence in the community including attention to the unhoused
                        population;
                 •      Drug issues;
                 •      Addressing concerns regarding gangs;
                 •      Youth issues;
                 •      Mental health
                 •      Traffic;
                 •      Property crime and theft;
                 •      Cybercrime;
                 •      Online fraud; and
                 •      Social media driven issues particularly those affecting youth.

THAT Committee recommend that Council approve the following funding applications
           for the 2026 year:

               1. Open Gate Church: $6,000
